	"Name": "Drift Strand",
	"Author": "Lykkio",
	"Description": "You've inherited a... 'rustic' old cottage on a secret beach that hasn't had any visitors in who knows how long.\n<br />\n<br />Perks include:\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]One bonus item in the starter gift\n<br />[*]Blue grass\n<br />[*]Invisible animal barriers keep them in the upper left corner\n<br />[*]Secret mushroom warp to the farm cave, in the upper right corner\n<br />[*]Additional farm version exclusive: Night market fish. Yes, it's overpowered. Drift Strand is off the beaten path and has become home to many rare species...\n<br />[/list]\n<br />The replacement version replaces the beach farm.\n<br />\n<br />If this looks very familiar, it's because after a lot of time spent playing around with maps, I wanted to redo my first mod, First Light. While taking up the same screen space, this version has more usable space.\n<br />\n<br />Please note that in vanilla and some recolors, the mushroom used to enter the cave is invisible during winter - it still works, though!",
